<title>USA: Innovex votes 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Innovex votes 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOPKINS, Minn. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovex Inc said Wednesday its board of directors voted a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The additional shares will be payable December 23 to shareholders of record on the close of business December 16.</p>
<p>The board also elected to increase the authorized number of shares by 100 percent to 30,000,000 common shares.</p>
<p>Innovex makes electrical components for the computer electronics and medical instruments markets, and develops computer software.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
